  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252faether-protect-your-moa\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Prospector/badges/master/modrinth-badge-72h-padded.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"183\" height=\"72\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fen.wikipedia.org%252fwiki%252fAll_rights_reserved\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/assets license-All Rights Reserved-red.svg?style=flat-square\" alt=\"\" width=\"204\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/The-Aether-Team/Protect-Your-Moa/blob/1.19.4-develop/LICENSE.txt\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/code license-LGPL v3.0-green.svg?style=flat-square\" alt=\"\" width=\"142\" height=\"20\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://patreon.com/TheAetherTeam\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=TheAetherTeam&type=patrons&style=flat-square&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"147\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/aethermod\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/118816101936267265.svg?label=discord&logoColor=FFFFFF&logo=discord&color=7289DA&style=flat-square\" alt=\"\" width=\"141\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/DevAether\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/twitter-@DevAether-lightgrey?style=flat-square&logo=twitter&color=1DA1F2&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"143\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmastodon.gamedev.place%252f%2540DevAether\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/mastodon/follow/110581810287361848?domain=https://mastodon.gamedev.place/&style=flat-square&logo=mastodon&logoColor=white&label=mastodon&color=858AFA\" alt=\"Mastodon\" width=\"99\" height=\"20\"></a>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbsky.app%252fprofile%252faether-mod.net\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://custom-icon-badges.demolab.com/badge/bluesky-@aether--mod--net-green?logo=cloud&logoSource=feather&style=flat-square&color=0085ff\" alt=\"\" width=\"179\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.threads.net%252f%2540devaether\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://custom-icon-badges.demolab.com/badge/threads-devaether-green?logo=instagram-threads&style=flat-square&color=000000\" alt=\"\" width=\"133\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.facebook.com%252fAetherMod\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/facebook-AetherMod-blue?logo=facebook&style=flat-square&color=1877F2&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"145\" height=\"20\"></a>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/devaether-instagram?color=D50060&label=instagram&logo=instagram&style=flat-square&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.tiktok.com%252f%2540devaether\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/@devaether-tiktok?color=000000&label=tiktok&logo=tiktok&style=flat-square&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"135\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@DevAether\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/youtube-@DevAether-blue?color=FF0000&label=youtube&logo=youtube&style=flat-square\" alt=\"\" width=\"151\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/theaetherteam\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitch/status/theaetherteam?logo=twitch&style=flat-square&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"103\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.reddit.com%252fr%252fTheAether%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/TheAether-reddit?color=FF4500&label=reddit&logo=reddit&style=flat-square&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"127\" height=\"20\"></a>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252faether.wiki.gg%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://custom-icon-badges.demolab.com/badge/wiki.gg-aether-green?logo=wikigg&style=flat-square&color=FF1980\" alt=\"\" width=\"111\" height=\"20\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>🛡️ 關於此擴充包 🛡️<br></strong></span></h2>\n<p>Protect Your Moa 擴充包實作了在探索中利用莫亞（Moa）的新方式。<strong>莫亞護甲</strong>可製作以提供莫亞更高的防護，或在特定類型（如重力鎢莫亞護甲）中賦予新能力，例如額外跳躍。玩家還可為莫亞裝備<strong>箱子</strong>，讓它們攜帶額外的儲存空間。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/The-Aether-Team/.github/b65b3a3a53985b0cdf10bc1cb6c3728f5ffbf638/images/protectYourMoa0.png\" width=\"1167\" height=\"402\"></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>☁️ 更多來自 Aether Team 的作品 ☁️</strong></span></h2>\n<p>如果您對該擴充包有任何疑問，或只是想了解 Aether Team 開發的其他專案，歡迎加入 Aether Project Discord！我們友善的工作人員與熱情好客的社群將讓您有賓至如歸的感覺！</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/aethermod\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/The-Aether-Team/.github/main/images/image4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"282\" height=\"102\"></a></p>\n<p>您也可以在 Patreon 上贊助 Aether Team！每一筆贊助都将直接投入開發，讓我們能持續堅持做我們最熱愛的事。<a href=\"https://patreon.com/TheAetherTeam\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/The-Aether-Team/.github/main/images/image3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"434\" height=\"102\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
